{"unit_id":"tag:02WI:prose-0005","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n在该引理的情形下，对于引理中的任何态射（morphism）<MATH_0001>，说<MATH_0002>具有性质<MATH_0003>是有意义的，这里的性质可以是定义<REF_0001>中的任意性质。特别地，这适用于<MATH_0004>为“满射（surjective）”和<MATH_0005>为“平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）”的情形，见上面的注记<REF_0002>。我们将在下面代数空间（algebraic spaces）的定义中使用这个注记。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"引理中的可表态射。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"用于定义代数空间的相对性质。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"用于定义代数空间的相对性质。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"后面的代数空间定义。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0CB7:proof","translation":"注意，<MATH_0001>可表（representable），依据是引理<REF_0001>。我们可以将条件 (2) 表述为变换<MATH_0002>具有性质<MATH_0003>，见引理<REF_0002>。考虑<MATH_0004>和<MATH_0005>。注意，有交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0006>\n其中两个方块都是笛卡尔（cartesian）的。由此可知，态射（morphism）<MATH_0007>是具有性质<MATH_0008>的某个态射（morphism）沿<MATH_0009>的基变换（base change）。由于<MATH_0010>在基变换（base change）下保持，这就完成了证明。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"cartesian","target_term":"笛卡尔"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表","context":"对角的可表性。"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图","context":"比较两个基变换的交换图。"},{"source_term":"cartesian","target_term":"笛卡尔","context":"图中两个方块是纤维积方块。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"满足相对性质的态射。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"性质在基变换下保持。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:025Z:proof","translation":"函子（functor）<MATH_0001>是层（sheaf），依据是第<REF_0001>节中的注记。对角<MATH_0002>可表（representable），因为<MATH_0003>有纤维积（fibre products）。恒等映射（identity map）<MATH_0004>是满射（surjective）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）的。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表"},{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积"},{"source_term":"identity map","target_term":"恒等映射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"概形对应的函子。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"该函子满足层条件。"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表","context":"对角的可表性。"},{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积","context":"概形有纤维积。"},{"source_term":"identity map","target_term":"恒等映射","context":"概形到其对应函子的恒等映射。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"恒等映射的满射性。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"恒等映射的平展性。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:02X0:proof","translation":"显然，<MATH_0001>是层（sheaf）。<MATH_0002>的对角就是<MATH_0003>和<MATH_0004>的对角的积（product）。因此，它可表（representable），依据是引理<REF_0001>。最后，若<MATH_0005>和<MATH_0006>是满射（surjective）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）态射（morphisms），且<MATH_0007>，则<MATH_0008>是满射（surjective）平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）的，依据是引理<REF_0002>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"product","target_term":"积"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"乘积满足层条件。"},{"source_term":"product","target_term":"积","context":"对角的积。"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表","context":"乘积的对角可表。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"呈现态射的满射性。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"两个呈现态射是平展的。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"呈现态射。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"乘积态射仍平展。"}],"notes":[]}
